WEBVTT

00:00:19.380 --> 00:00:21.250
In this "Day of Conjunction" book,

00:00:21.250 --> 00:00:25.590
they say that the Subway connects all the
various worlds of Wonderland.

00:00:25.590 --> 00:00:26.610
Yu!

00:00:27.620 --> 00:00:30.090
You're the one who likes this bird, aren't you?!

00:00:30.090 --> 00:00:31.620
Do something about him!

00:00:32.760 --> 00:00:35.760
I think doing that makes him feel good,
like chewing on a pacifier.

00:00:35.760 --> 00:00:37.960
What makes you think you know that?!

00:00:38.070 --> 00:00:39.900
It seems that when I wear this feather,

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:42.660
I can sense Chocobo's feelings.

00:00:43.670 --> 00:00:44.970
Chocobo's feelings?

00:00:45.070 --> 00:00:47.740
Yeah, it just kind of floats into me.

00:00:47.840 --> 00:00:49.640
Floats in, my butt.

00:00:50.550 --> 00:00:55.280
Even so, I still don't know where
the Subway is headed.

00:01:23.340 --> 00:01:29.150
Daichi ni sosogu yoake

00:01:23.340 --> 00:01:29.150
The light of dawn pours over the vast Earth

00:01:31.020 --> 00:01:36.650
Tabidatsu toki wo tsugeru

00:01:31.020 --> 00:01:36.650
And marks the beginning of our journey

00:01:38.630 --> 00:01:45.760
Mirai wo mezashi kaketeyuku kaze

00:01:38.630 --> 00:01:45.760
With our eyes on the future

00:01:46.230 --> 00:01:51.870
Kono mune ni suikonda

00:01:46.230 --> 00:01:51.870
I deeply breathe in the rushing wind

00:01:55.510 --> 00:02:01.510
Yume dake wo kizamitsuketa hitomi

00:01:55.510 --> 00:02:01.510
The eyes that could only speak in dreams

00:02:03.380 --> 00:02:09.020
Bokura ni yuku michi wo ataeru

00:02:03.380 --> 00:02:09.020
Presented us with the path we're to take

00:02:10.930 --> 00:02:14.730
Fly to the Neverland

00:02:10.930 --> 00:02:14.730
Fly to the Neverland

00:02:14.800 --> 00:02:24.230
Kagiri nai yuuki wo mezamesasete

00:02:14.800 --> 00:02:24.230
Awaken the unlimited courage inside of us

00:02:34.520 --> 00:02:36.850
Welcome to the night of Wonderland.

00:02:39.220 --> 00:02:42.450
I am Fabula, your guide.

00:02:44.760 --> 00:02:46.660
Of the things that I can see...

00:02:48.100 --> 00:02:50.030
A group of lost travelers...

00:02:52.900 --> 00:02:54.870
A fighting young lady...

00:02:56.300 --> 00:02:58.330
A resurrected man...

00:02:59.710 --> 00:03:01.770
An old woman who rides atop a bird...

00:03:02.340 --> 00:03:06.340
When the Magun is let loose,
Wonderland will tremble,

00:03:06.950 --> 00:03:11.680
and at the next stop of the Subway,
there will be...

00:03:25.270 --> 00:03:27.230
How's Chaos coming along?

00:03:27.640 --> 00:03:31.810
He has just consumed another one
of the Outside Worlds,

00:03:31.810 --> 00:03:34.000
and is doing fantastic.

00:03:34.680 --> 00:03:35.700
Oh?

00:03:36.180 --> 00:03:37.540
Your Excellency?

00:03:37.650 --> 00:03:39.110
What is it?

00:03:39.210 --> 00:03:42.650
About that Man of the Black Wind,
who uses the Magun...

00:03:43.650 --> 00:03:50.220
It is my guess from his abilities
that he might be Unlimited.

00:03:50.830 --> 00:03:52.490
Unlimited?

00:03:52.590 --> 00:03:55.590
It means a person whose power
exceeds that of a god's.

00:03:58.600 --> 00:04:00.470
I'm the one who's God here!

00:04:00.570 --> 00:04:03.870
There is nothing that exists
that can exceed my power.

00:04:03.970 --> 00:04:05.940
Yes, you are correct.

00:04:07.000 --> 00:04:10.650
Go take care of him quickly.
Okay, Makenshi?

00:04:07.000 --> 00:04:10.650
Note: Makenshi means Demon Swordsman

00:04:20.960 --> 00:04:24.950
Your Excellency, before Makenshi does him in,

00:04:25.060 --> 00:04:27.620
I want to try taking a look at
that little Magun darling.

00:04:27.730 --> 00:04:30.700
What's wrong, Herba, you want
to have some more fun?

00:04:30.800 --> 00:04:32.270
Oh yes, very much so.

00:04:35.270 --> 00:04:37.170
You've been bothering us for too long!

00:04:37.270 --> 00:04:38.830
Get over there, you pitiful loser!

00:04:44.950 --> 00:04:47.380
I thought I was going to die!

00:04:48.980 --> 00:04:51.250
So can the immortal Fungus actually be killed?

00:04:51.250 --> 00:04:55.490
I cannot die. Even if I am ripped
to pieces and scattered all over,

00:04:55.490 --> 00:04:57.820
no matter how many times, I will
still be able to come back to life!

00:04:58.290 --> 00:05:03.930
But it will take a little while before
I can return to my original size.

00:05:06.430 --> 00:05:07.460
Pathetic!

00:05:32.360 --> 00:05:33.420
What?!

00:05:43.300 --> 00:05:45.400
Not another weird place!

00:05:45.510 --> 00:05:47.800
It's useless. We'll never get out of here.

00:05:49.210 --> 00:05:51.140
They look like people, don't they?

00:05:51.580 --> 00:05:57.310
I've been here my whole life,
but my world isn't anywhere.

00:05:57.420 --> 00:05:59.780
Because nothing is left of me.

00:05:59.890 --> 00:06:04.520
I just sit in a place like this day
after day, eating this fruit.

00:06:04.760 --> 00:06:09.560
Look, all the people here do
is sit and whine like this,

00:06:09.560 --> 00:06:12.160
but we can't move or run away from it.

00:06:12.600 --> 00:06:14.300
I don't like this place.

00:06:14.870 --> 00:06:18.860
There's no way Mom and Dad
could be in a place like this.

00:06:18.970 --> 00:06:21.270
I think you're right. But just to be safe,

00:06:21.380 --> 00:06:24.830
why don't we search around or
something until the Subway leaves?

00:06:32.590 --> 00:06:33.760
Hey, Mister!

00:06:33.760 --> 00:06:34.620
The Magun guy?

00:06:34.620 --> 00:06:37.020
Yeah, it's Mister Windmill.

00:06:39.190 --> 00:06:40.090
What?!

00:06:42.400 --> 00:06:46.730
I guess I was wrong.
Yeah, he couldn't be here.

00:06:46.830 --> 00:06:50.900
We came by the Subway, there's no
way he could have beat us here.

00:06:54.640 --> 00:06:58.170
I see, everything here is made of fruit.

00:06:58.280 --> 00:06:59.510
Can you eat it?

00:07:02.220 --> 00:07:05.740
Sniff, sniff. Smells good!

00:07:05.850 --> 00:07:09.620
Sis, are you sure you should be eating that?

00:07:10.260 --> 00:07:13.630
Do you think you could stop making
that grossed-out face at me?

00:07:13.730 --> 00:07:17.430
This is Wonderland. It's not
the world we're used to.

00:07:17.930 --> 00:07:20.060
This is perfectly normal in Wonderland.

00:07:20.500 --> 00:07:23.300
That's what is written in
"Day of Conjunction."

00:07:28.310 --> 00:07:29.870
Hey! Thief!

00:07:29.980 --> 00:07:31.140
Sis!

00:07:31.250 --> 00:07:33.040
Wait, Ai! I will...

00:07:37.490 --> 00:07:39.850
Chocobo! Go catch Sis!

00:07:43.360 --> 00:07:44.850
It's no use.

00:07:48.600 --> 00:07:50.760
Stop thief!

00:08:03.480 --> 00:08:04.640
Hey!

00:08:06.050 --> 00:08:09.850
Wait! Give me back my backpack!

00:08:44.490 --> 00:08:47.680
You mustn't oppose the Earl.

00:08:48.560 --> 00:08:51.320
He is not of this world.

00:08:51.430 --> 00:08:55.360
Earl Tyrant is protected by the
Four Lords of Gaudium.

00:08:56.200 --> 00:08:59.660
If you're looking for something,
you should ask them.

00:09:00.970 --> 00:09:03.490
If you don't value your life, that is.

00:09:04.170 --> 00:09:05.660
Excuse me...

00:09:14.450 --> 00:09:17.140
A guy didn't happen to just
come in here, did he?

00:09:17.250 --> 00:09:19.150
He was wearing a cloak over his head.

00:09:19.690 --> 00:09:23.950
It was a cloak just like all
of you guys are wearing.

00:09:25.490 --> 00:09:27.460
He came in here, didn't he?!

00:09:29.300 --> 00:09:32.030
He must have come in here!
I saw him myself!

00:09:32.130 --> 00:09:35.130
That's the thief! Do you know where he went?!

00:09:43.310 --> 00:09:45.370
It's useless to look for anything.

00:09:45.480 --> 00:09:49.310
Once you lose something,
you'll never get it back again!

00:09:50.480 --> 00:09:53.480
Once you come to Wonderland,
you must obey the rules here!

00:09:54.690 --> 00:09:57.250
That is the rule of Wonderland!

00:09:58.130 --> 00:10:00.320
It's the rule!

00:10:10.910 --> 00:10:12.200
Chaos...

00:10:13.140 --> 00:10:17.700
Oh no, it looks like I'm lost.

00:10:17.810 --> 00:10:22.110
I had so many important things in my backpack.

00:10:41.940 --> 00:10:45.270
Man, I hate it here.

00:10:46.040 --> 00:10:49.740
Yu! Lisa! Where are you?!

00:10:50.950 --> 00:10:52.880
Dad!

00:10:53.780 --> 00:10:56.340
Mom!

00:11:02.490 --> 00:11:04.860
I hear waves. Is there an ocean?

00:11:30.690 --> 00:11:33.920
I am Fabula, your guide.

00:11:41.300 --> 00:11:43.260
I see, you lost your bag.

00:11:43.560 --> 00:11:46.690
They all told me to quit looking,
that it was useless,

00:11:46.800 --> 00:11:50.200
even though they just talk and
don't do anything themselves.

00:11:52.870 --> 00:11:57.610
So what is all this stuff you have here?
It's all so strange.

00:11:58.980 --> 00:12:02.640
I can't tell if it's beautiful or gross,
it's just all so weird.

00:12:17.830 --> 00:12:20.300
How creepy and cute!

00:12:20.400 --> 00:12:21.870
If you like, I'll give it to you.

00:12:21.970 --> 00:12:23.300
Really, are you sure?

00:12:27.480 --> 00:12:31.410
That guy is Poshepocket.
Take good care of him.

00:12:31.510 --> 00:12:32.640
Poshepocket?

00:12:36.250 --> 00:12:37.580
Thank you!

00:12:37.690 --> 00:12:40.810
If you wish for something,
he will make it a reality.

00:12:40.920 --> 00:12:42.510
So don't give up.

00:13:00.610 --> 00:13:01.970
What is that thing?

00:13:03.040 --> 00:13:04.270
What?

00:13:15.720 --> 00:13:17.250
So where is the Magun baby?

00:13:19.160 --> 00:13:20.560
It's one of the Earl's henchmen!

00:13:20.660 --> 00:13:23.290
We're about to all be fed to Chaos!

00:13:23.400 --> 00:13:26.460
It's no use running!
But I don't want to die!

00:13:26.730 --> 00:13:28.030
The Earl!

00:14:20.860 --> 00:14:22.790
It's all over for us!

00:14:22.890 --> 00:14:24.520
Help us!

00:14:37.100 --> 00:14:39.700
Why are you making such a mean face?

00:14:40.510 --> 00:14:42.030
Where is the Earl?!

00:14:42.540 --> 00:14:44.640
Oh, I'm not enough for you?

00:14:46.910 --> 00:14:49.180
Whoa there, you're being too hasty.

00:14:49.280 --> 00:14:51.650
Won't you try using the Magun
that everyone is talking about?

00:14:53.520 --> 00:14:56.150
Please, hurry up and use it on me!

00:14:56.260 --> 00:14:57.920
Come on now.

00:15:07.840 --> 00:15:09.200
Kaze?!

00:15:09.300 --> 00:15:10.670
What's going on here?!

00:15:14.710 --> 00:15:17.110
Hey, she's pretty cute!

00:15:17.110 --> 00:15:18.840
Let me give her a little pollen.

00:15:29.590 --> 00:15:30.580
Lisa! Yu!

00:15:30.690 --> 00:15:32.020
Don't come any closer!

00:15:32.530 --> 00:15:36.050
It's so fun to breathe in this pollen.

00:15:36.160 --> 00:15:37.600
How amusing.

00:15:45.070 --> 00:15:47.840
That's all right. Please, go ahead
and take care of them if you like.

00:15:49.140 --> 00:15:53.610
The more you kill, the more fun it becomes
for everyone else enjoying the pollen.

00:15:53.610 --> 00:15:54.980
So how about it?

00:15:54.980 --> 00:15:58.110
I wonder if you're having too much fun
to shoot the Magun?

00:16:02.090 --> 00:16:03.450
Go away!

00:16:07.760 --> 00:16:10.660
<i>If you wish for something,
he will make it a reality.</i>

00:16:13.230 --> 00:16:16.290
Please, give me the power to save everyone!

00:16:21.110 --> 00:16:22.600
A watermelon seed?

00:16:34.120 --> 00:16:34.990
What the...

00:16:34.990 --> 00:16:36.120
We're cured.

00:16:42.830 --> 00:16:43.890
It has moved.

00:16:44.530 --> 00:16:47.000
What?! What happened to my
little pollen babies?!

00:16:47.100 --> 00:16:49.230
Soil is my power!

00:17:06.320 --> 00:17:07.750
A jigsaw puzzle?

00:17:17.700 --> 00:17:20.570
The Magun has thawed!

00:17:25.610 --> 00:17:27.100
Please try shooting me!

00:17:27.540 --> 00:17:31.740
Just like you beat Fungus,
turn me into a pressed flower.

00:17:32.250 --> 00:17:36.510
But the more of these guys you kill,
the faster they'll continue to sprout.

00:17:36.980 --> 00:17:39.710
The appropriate Soil to use against
you has been decided!

00:17:43.720 --> 00:17:47.090
The cry of a soul without light,
Dark Green!

00:17:53.430 --> 00:17:57.770
The one who forbids the birth of life,
Virgin White!

00:18:03.010 --> 00:18:06.640
And finally, to freeze all things,
Ice Blue!

00:18:14.660 --> 00:18:15.710
Mister!

00:18:18.990 --> 00:18:22.660
Shine! I summon you, Shiva!

00:19:08.180 --> 00:19:09.540
So cold!

00:19:09.640 --> 00:19:12.870
He's too tricky! It's not fair
to make things this cold!

00:19:20.090 --> 00:19:21.520
Earl!

00:19:21.620 --> 00:19:22.650
Excuse me...

00:19:23.520 --> 00:19:24.920
Thank you, Mister.

00:19:26.290 --> 00:19:28.820
Have you gotten any closer to
the person you're looking for?

00:19:31.830 --> 00:19:32.920
Sis!

00:19:33.030 --> 00:19:34.900
Ai, I'm so glad you're safe.

00:19:35.000 --> 00:19:37.030
Yeah, but my clothes got all sticky.

00:19:37.670 --> 00:19:39.100
What's that thing?

00:19:40.670 --> 00:19:42.370
It looks alive, doesn't it?!

00:19:42.740 --> 00:19:44.870
A woman named Fabula gave him to me.

00:19:44.980 --> 00:19:46.810
His name is Poshepocket.

00:19:46.810 --> 00:19:48.340
Isn't he so creepy and cute?!

00:19:50.780 --> 00:19:53.410
I sure hope that thing is not a bad guy.

00:19:53.520 --> 00:19:57.890
Don't worry, he just saved everyone, so...

00:19:58.490 --> 00:20:00.980
What? Where did Mister go?

00:20:03.960 --> 00:20:05.900
That guy is pretty weird too, isn't he?

00:20:06.500 --> 00:20:09.400
They told me that once you lose something here,

00:20:09.500 --> 00:20:11.560
then you'll never get it back again.

00:20:12.040 --> 00:20:17.200
But I guess the rules of Wonderland
don't apply to us, do they?!

00:20:17.310 --> 00:20:18.610
So I'm sure!

00:20:18.710 --> 00:20:21.080
We'll find Mom and Dad!

00:20:27.960 --> 00:20:28.980
What?!

00:20:29.090 --> 00:20:30.650
Chocobo is still acting weird.

00:20:31.290 --> 00:20:32.660
This is bad!

00:20:32.660 --> 00:20:34.650
He's saying the Subway is about to leave!

00:20:37.900 --> 00:20:39.390
We've got to hurry up...

00:20:39.500 --> 00:20:40.990
Or we'll never make it!

00:20:53.910 --> 00:20:55.650
Nodo ga karakara desu

00:20:53.910 --> 00:20:55.650
I am so thirsty

00:20:55.650 --> 00:20:57.020
Taihen nan desu

00:20:55.650 --> 00:20:57.020
It's really getting bad

00:20:57.020 --> 00:20:59.140
Kono mune ookaji desu

00:20:57.020 --> 00:20:59.140
It's burning up inside of me

00:20:59.750 --> 00:21:02.490
Kimi wo hitome mita

00:20:59.750 --> 00:21:02.490
My heart skipped a beat

00:21:02.490 --> 00:21:05.390
Shunkan bibi tto kita

00:21:02.490 --> 00:21:05.390
When I laid eyes on you

00:21:05.390 --> 00:21:07.060
Goumon no you desu

00:21:05.390 --> 00:21:07.060
It's just like torture

00:21:07.060 --> 00:21:08.500
Taekirenai desu

00:21:07.060 --> 00:21:08.500
I can't take it

00:21:08.500 --> 00:21:10.520
Kimi ni koi shite kara

00:21:08.500 --> 00:21:10.520
Ever since I fell in love with you

00:21:11.330 --> 00:21:14.000
Itsumo kimi to nita

00:21:11.330 --> 00:21:14.000
My heart skips a beat whenever

00:21:14.000 --> 00:21:16.490
Kamigata ni ha to suru

00:21:14.000 --> 00:21:16.490
I see a girl with hair like yours

00:21:16.940 --> 00:21:20.570
Douka kamisama

00:21:16.940 --> 00:21:20.570
Please, God

00:21:20.570 --> 00:21:24.880
Kono boku ni tsubasa kudasai yo

00:21:20.570 --> 00:21:24.880
Can you please give me wings?

00:21:24.880 --> 00:21:28.420
Kore kare kimi dake wo motto tsuyoku

00:21:24.880 --> 00:21:28.420
From now on, my thoughts of you

00:21:28.420 --> 00:21:31.040
Omotchatte kirakira

00:21:28.420 --> 00:21:31.040
Will only shine and grow stronger

00:21:31.250 --> 00:21:34.050
Tsutaetai koto ippai

00:21:31.250 --> 00:21:34.050
There's so much I want to tell you

00:21:34.050 --> 00:21:37.060
Jikan ga tarinai nai ai ai

00:21:34.050 --> 00:21:37.060
There's not enough time left in the world

00:21:37.060 --> 00:21:39.890
Boku no hitomi ni wa mou

00:21:37.060 --> 00:21:39.890
You are now the only person

00:21:39.890 --> 00:21:42.230
Kimi shika utsuranai

00:21:39.890 --> 00:21:42.230
That my eyes can see

00:21:42.230 --> 00:21:44.930
Kitai wa kore kara

00:21:42.230 --> 00:21:44.930
Now I've got my hopes set high

00:21:44.930 --> 00:21:48.140
Nani kara nani made omoikitchatte

00:21:44.930 --> 00:21:48.140
All of these thoughts are too much for me

00:21:48.140 --> 00:21:51.070
Sa subete wo butsukeyou

00:21:48.140 --> 00:21:51.070
So I'm just going to spill my guts

00:21:51.170 --> 00:21:57.040
Seikai wa dare ni mo wakanai ai ai ai ai

00:21:51.170 --> 00:21:57.040
Nobody knows the right answer

00:21:57.040 --> 00:21:59.850
Atama no naka de wa mou

00:21:57.040 --> 00:21:59.850
I'm already celebrating my joy

00:21:59.850 --> 00:22:02.220
Shukufuku no kurakkaa

00:21:59.850 --> 00:22:02.220
On the inside

00:22:02.220 --> 00:22:05.190
Nani ka ga hajimaru

00:22:02.220 --> 00:22:05.190
Something is going to start

00:22:05.190 --> 00:22:07.920
Kitai wa kore kara

00:22:05.190 --> 00:22:07.920
Now I've got my hopes set high

00:22:07.920 --> 00:22:12.030
Nozomi wo mochimashou

00:22:07.920 --> 00:22:12.030
Let's never lose sight of our dreams

00:22:12.030 --> 00:22:13.390
All right!

00:22:12.030 --> 00:22:13.390
All right!

00:22:16.630 --> 00:22:19.500
Final Fantasy: Unlimited

00:22:23.200 --> 00:22:24.800
Here is my prophecy.

00:22:26.040 --> 00:22:27.940
Left behind by the Subway.

00:22:28.440 --> 00:22:30.410
Those lurking underground...

00:22:31.140 --> 00:22:33.440
He becomes visible from beyond the Mist.

00:22:33.550 --> 00:22:34.950
The strongest enemy of them all...

00:22:41.020 --> 00:22:43.750
Next time, I will return to offer you
my Unlimited guidance.
